WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.393
You opened an account.

00:00:01.452 --> 00:00:03.471
You found the stock
everybody's talking about.

00:00:03.728 --> 00:00:05.342
Now you're looking at a big green button,

00:00:05.342 --> 00:00:07.581
thinking the two most
expensive words in trading.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:08.585
What now?

00:00:09.485 --> 00:00:10.621
So you ask around.

00:00:10.994 --> 00:00:12.374
The group chat says buy.

00:00:12.782 --> 00:00:14.882
Some guy online says it's going to zero.

00:00:15.197 --> 00:00:17.576
And your buddy, who has
never once shown you a trade,

00:00:17.577 --> 00:00:18.493
says trust him.

00:00:19.123 --> 00:00:21.990
That question is the whole
reason Friendly Trader exists.

00:00:22.496 --> 00:00:23.725
Never done this before?

00:00:24.063 --> 00:00:26.280
Start with 28 free options lessons,

00:00:26.397 --> 00:00:27.987
from Main Street to Wall Street.

00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:29.810
Every lesson has a practice trade,

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.783
so your first mistakes cost you nothing.

00:00:32.135 --> 00:00:33.586
Looking for something to trade?

00:00:33.912 --> 00:00:35.758
Patterns gives you real chart setups,

00:00:35.758 --> 00:00:39.263
with the price that confirms each
one and the price that breaks it.

00:00:39.561 --> 00:00:40.570
Found one you like?

00:00:40.884 --> 00:00:44.877
One tap, and Stop Finder puts your stop
and your targets right on the chart,

00:00:45.029 --> 00:00:47.478
so you know where you're getting
out before you ever get in.

00:00:47.825 --> 00:00:49.205
Not sure what something means?

00:00:49.636 --> 00:00:51.737
Ask Pip, right there on the screen.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.757
No question is too basic.

00:00:54.099 --> 00:00:56.316
Wondering what could move
your stock this week?

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.916
Earnings and economic
reports are laid out,

00:00:59.010 --> 00:00:59.822
day by day.

00:01:00.194 --> 00:01:02.074
And when you'd rather ask a real person,

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.779
there's a room full of traders
learning the same way you are.

00:01:05.454 --> 00:01:07.717
So next time you're looking
at that big green button,

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:09.412
you already know where you're getting out,

00:01:09.529 --> 00:01:11.060
and what you'll do if you're wrong.

00:01:11.285 --> 00:01:12.816
There's no crystal ball in here.

00:01:13.107 --> 00:01:13.896
Just a plan,

00:01:14.268 --> 00:01:15.219
and good company.

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:16.648
Friendly Trader.

00:01:17.149 --> 00:01:18.622
Coming soon to the App Store.

00:01:18.925 --> 00:01:20.782
Try it right now, on this page,

00:01:20.794 --> 00:01:21.768
no account needed.
